# Sunshine Coast School Incursions – African Drumming & Dance Workshops

[Quick & Easy Quote](/quick-quote/)

#### Bring African Drumming, Singing and Dance to Your School

Bring the energy of African drumming, singing and dance to your school with Rhythm Culture's interactive **Sunshine Coast school incursions** and workshops across South East Queensland.

Our hands-on workshops introduce students to the vibrant rhythms, music and movement of West Africa. Through individual drumming and dance workshops, as well as our popular **Drum Sing Dance program**, students have the opportunity to get involved, learn together and experience the excitement of making music as a group.

#### Interactive Drum Sing Dance Program

Our Drum Sing Dance program gives primary and secondary students the opportunity to experience traditional West African rhythms and movement in a lively, hands-on group environment.

Throughout the workshop, students learn drumming patterns, explore rhythm and dance, and discover how individual contributions come together to create an ensemble. In addition, singing, movement and group participation encourage students to listen, collaborate and connect through music.

