#### African Drumming & Dance Workshops for Schools

Whether you're organising a school cultural day, music program, Harmony Week celebration, performing arts day or special event, our African drumming and dance workshops offer an engaging way to bring students together.

With all instruments supplied and activities led by experienced facilitators, students can participate regardless of their previous musical or dance experience. As a result, everyone has the opportunity to be involved, explore their creativity and enjoy the experience of making music together.

#### School Incursions Across the Sunshine Coast & South East Queensland

Based on the Sunshine Coast, Rhythm Culture specialises in engaging **school incursions on the Sunshine Coast** and throughout South East Queensland. We work with primary schools, secondary schools and educational organisations, bringing the instruments, music and energy directly to your school.

From smaller group workshops to whole-school events, we can discuss your requirements and tailor an experience to suit your students and school community.

